# Reusable UI components

Follow `doc/reusable-ui.md`.

## Must

- Import shared UI from `src/components/ui` (Button, ChoiceRow, WeekdayPicker, EmptyState, FormDialog, SheetDialog, ScreenShell, BottomTabBar, …).
- If a pattern repeats or matches the inventory, **reuse or extend the kit** — do not paste a new chip row, empty state, modal shell, or tab bar.
- After adding a shared component, export it from `src/components/ui/index.ts` and update `doc/reusable-ui.md`.

## Must not

- Reimplement choice chips, weekday toggles, empty states, bottom tab bars, or centered/sheet dialog chrome inline.
- Put DB / repository / native-bridge calls inside `src/components/ui/*`.

## Exceptions

Feature-specific layouts listed under “Leave feature-specific” in `doc/reusable-ui.md` (streak share cards, timer hero, charts, vault PIN copy, etc.).
